### ==============================================================================
### FinCore Nexus - Enterprise Digital Banking Platform REST API Collection
### Works with VS Code REST Client, IntelliJ HTTP Client, and curl
### All requests route through API Gateway (Port 8080) by default
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@gatewayActuator = http://localhost:8080/actuator

# Direct Microservice Ports (if running standalone or bypassing gateway):
@coreBankingUrl = http://localhost:8081/api
@loanServiceUrl = http://localhost:8082/api
@paymentServiceUrl = http://localhost:8083/api
@kycServiceUrl = http://localhost:8084/api
@notificationServiceUrl = http://localhost:8085/api

# Standard Credentials (Base64 for HTTP Basic Auth):
# teller / teller123     -> Basic dGVsbGVyOnRlbGxlcjEyMw==
# manager / manager123   -> Basic bWFuYWdlcjptYW5hZ2VyMTIz
# admin / admin123       -> Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
# customer / customer123 -> Basic Y3VzdG9tZXI6Y3VzdG9tZXIxMjM=

@authTeller = Basic dGVsbGVyOnRlbGxlcjEyMw==
@authManager = Basic bWFuYWdlcjptYW5hZ2VyMTIz
@authAdmin = Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
@authCustomer = Basic Y3VzdG9tZXI6Y3VzdG9tZXIxMjM=


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 1: API GATEWAY & SYSTEM HEALTH
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Gateway Health & Routing Status
GET {{gatewayActuator}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Gateway Dynamic Route Discovery
GET {{gatewayActuator}}/gatewayroutes
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 2: AUTHENTICATION & REGISTRATION
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Register New Banking User (Customer / Teller)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "priya_sharma",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "ROLE_CUSTOMER"
}


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 3: CORE BANKING SERVICES (MILESTONE 1)
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Create Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Sharma",
  "email": "priya.sharma@example.com",
  "phone": "+919876543210"
}

### 3.2 List All Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.3 Create Savings Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "accountType": "SAVINGS",
  "initialDeposit": 25000.00
}

### 3.4 Get Account by Account Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-1001
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.5 Check Balance (Cached via Redis Cache-Aside with 60s TTL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-1001/balance
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.6 Deposit Funds (Instant Ledger Update + SHA-256 Hash Chain)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-1001/deposit
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "description": "Salary deposit via RTGS"
}

### 3.7 Withdraw Funds
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-1001/withdraw
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "description": "ATM cash withdrawal"
}

### 3.8 Internal Account-to-Account Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/transfer
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "ACC-1001",
  "targetAccountNumber": "ACC-1002",
  "amount": 3500.00,
  "description": "Monthly rent payment"
}

### 3.9 Account Statement with Paginated Ledger History
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-1001/statement?page=0&size=20
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.10 Real-Time Operational Dashboard Summary (Redis + DB Aggregations)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.11 Cryptographic Audit Trail Verification (Verifies Genesis-to-Head SHA-256 Hashes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/verify
Authorization: {{authAdmin}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 4: LOAN MANAGEMENT SERVICE (MILESTONE 2)
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Loan EMI & Amortisation Calculator (DECIMAL128 Precision)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "principal": 500000.00,
  "annualInterestRate": 10.50,
  "tenureMonths": 24
}

### 4.2 Submit Loan Application (Underwriting & Credit Scoring)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/apply
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "disbursementAccount": "ACC-1001",
  "principal": 250000.00,
  "annualInterestRate": 11.25,
  "tenureMonths": 18,
  "monthlyIncome": 85000.00,
  "existingEmiObligations": 12000.00,
  "employmentType": "SALARIED",
  "loanPurpose": "Home Improvement"
}

### 4.3 View Pending Loan Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/applications
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 Approve Loan Application (Triggers Distributed Kafka SAGA Disbursement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/applications/1/approve
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "notes": "Approved based on strong credit score (760) and healthy DTI ratio."
}

### 4.5 Reject Loan Application
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/applications/2/reject
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "Debt-to-income ratio exceeds regulatory threshold (65%)."
}

### 4.6 Get Active Loan Portfolio & Regulatory NPA Distribution
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/portfolio
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.7 Get Loan Details & Repayment Schedule
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/1
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.8 Collections & Delinquency Tracking (SMA-0 to NPA Buckets)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/collections
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 5: PAYMENT ORCHESTRATION SERVICE (MILESTONE 3)
### ==============================================================================

### 5.1 Register External Beneficiary
POST {{baseUrl}}/beneficiaries
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "beneficiaryName": "Rahul Verma",
  "accountNumber": "987654321098",
  "ifscCode": "HDFC0001234",
  "bankName": "HDFC Bank",
  "vpa": "rahul@hdfcbank"
}

### 5.2 List Registered Beneficiaries
GET {{baseUrl}}/beneficiaries?customerId=1
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.3 Execute Simulated Penny Drop Verification (INR 1.00 Validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/beneficiaries/1/verify
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.4 Execute Outward Payment (IMPS - Instant Gross Settlement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "senderAccountId": "ACC-1001",
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "amount": 7500.00,
  "rail": "IMPS",
  "purpose": "Vendor Settlement",
  "idempotencyKey": "PAY-REQ-20261114-001"
}

### 5.5 Execute Outward Payment (UPI - Instant VPA Transfer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "senderAccountId": "ACC-1001",
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "amount": 1250.00,
  "rail": "UPI",
  "purpose": "Bill Split",
  "idempotencyKey": "PAY-REQ-20261114-002"
}

### 5.6 Execute Outward Payment (NEFT - Batch Deferred Settlement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "senderAccountId": "ACC-1001",
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "amount": 150000.00,
  "rail": "NEFT",
  "purpose": "Capital Equipment Purchase",
  "idempotencyKey": "PAY-REQ-20261114-003"
}

### 5.7 Get Payment Status & SAGA Tracking by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.8 Get Clearing & Settlement Report (T+0 vs Batch Metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settlement/report
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.9 Trigger NEFT Hourly Batch Settlement (Clears Pending NEFT Transactions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/settlement/trigger-neft
Authorization: {{authAdmin}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 6: KYC & COMPLIANCE SERVICE (MILESTONE 4)
### ==============================================================================

### 6.1 Onboard Customer KYC (Verhoeff Aadhaar, PAN Regex, Simulated Biometrics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/onboard
Authorization: {{authTeller}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "customerName": "Priya Sharma",
  "pan": "ABCDE1234F",
  "aadhaarNumber": "234567890123",
  "dateOfBirth": "1994-08-15",
  "residentialAddress": "Flat 402, Green Valley Apartments, Bengaluru, Karnataka",
  "submittedBy": "teller"
}

### 6.2 Get Pending KYC Verification Queue (Maker-Checker In-tray)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kyc/pending
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.3 Get KYC Dossier by ID (Includes Masked PAN, Salted Aadhaar, Face Match & PEP Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kyc/1
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.4 Manager Review & Approval (Maker-Checker Rule Enforced: submittedBy != reviewedBy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/1/approve
Authorization: {{authManager}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reviewedBy": "manager",
  "notes": "Verified biometric selfie match (94.8%) and sanctions clean. Approved."
}

### 6.5 Dynamic PCI-DSS v4.0 Compliance Self-Assessment Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/compliance/pci-dss
Authorization: {{authAdmin}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.6 Cross-Service Cryptographic Audit Chain Verification (KYC + Core Banking)
GET {{baseUrl}}/compliance/audit/verify
Authorization: {{authAdmin}}
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 7: NOTIFICATION SERVICE (MILESTONES 3 & 4)
### ==============================================================================

### 7.1 Get Customer Notification Feed (Payment Receipts, Loan Status, KYC Alerts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?customerId=1
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Accept: application/json

### 7.2 Mark Notification as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1/read
Authorization: {{authCustomer}}
Accept: application/json
